"name": "Arion Banki hf",
"description": "Arion Banki HF is engaged in providing the services to households, corporates, institutions, and investors. It operates through the following segments: Retail Banking, Corporate & Investment Banking, and Markets. The Retail Banking segment offers services that include deposits and loans, savings, payment cards, pensions, insurance, securities, and funds. The Corporate & Investment Banking segment provides companies and investors with comprehensive financial services that meet the needs of each client, both in Iceland and internationally. The Markets segment consists of asset management and capital markets. The company was founded on October 18, 2008 and is headquartered in Reykjav\u00edk, Iceland.",
